# UriesmoothAI-videomini

A full-stack, real-time multimodal communications engine featuring cloned voice modulation, virtual avatar tracking, and an integrated financial settlement dashboard.

## Quick Start
1. Configure your `.env` file based on `.env.example`.
2. Start the Python AI Agent worker: `cd agent && python agent_worker.py start`
3. Launch the Financial Settlement API: `cd backend && uvicorn settlements:app --reload`
4. Run the Customer Dashboard: `cd